  "citation": "Andres R; Boden T; Marland G (1996): Annual Fossil-Fuel CO2 Emissions: Global Stable Carbon Isotopic Signature. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/FFE.DB1013.2017",
  "dataset": {
